  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 4202.13 “Terminal” means a reportable fuel storage and distribution facility that is supplied by pipeline or vessel and from which reportable fuel may be removed at a rack. The term includes bulk plants that store reportable fuel for others.\n\nSource. #10025, eff 11-16-11, EXPIRED: 11-16-19\n\nNew. ##, eff 4-7-20",
